    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we must ensure that we clients' professional secrecy obligations are respected through contractual agreements (DPA) aligned with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regular reviews of we control mapping and audit evidence production capabilities will also be necessary to mitigate compliance risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality, and adherence to legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also respect the auditor's independence and the separation of duties, and comply with anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we context, we have maintained regulatory compliance with the Security & Compliance function, specifically monitoring obligations such as GDPR, professional secrecy, anti-money-laundering framework, auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit, and legal retention obligations for accounting documents.  we contractual experience includes familiarity with clients bound by professional secrecy and confidentiality undertakings. we intellectual property model ensures that client data ownership is retained by the client, and we reversibility plan provides for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, potential legal risks may include ensuring that we hosting and integration partners comply with EU-only data hosting requirements, and verifying that we proprietary third-party models accessed under commercial licenses do not compromise we GDPR compliance.  we appear to be generally compliant with the specified regulatory requirements, as we have experience with respecting professional secrecy, confidentiality, and adherence to legal retention obligations for accounting documents, and we monitor auditor-independence and anti-money-laundering obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, a thorough review of we specific implementation and partner agreements would be necessary to confirm full compliance with the specified regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is €220,000 over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled, and the titleholder must propose an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and what cost-optimisation strategies can our propose? our target gross margin range is between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs and stay within The client's budget of €220,000 over 3 years, our can propose a cost-efficient configuration, favoring tiers and models that protect our gross margin and provide predictable recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that one-off project costs are expected to account for 40% of the total budget, which is €88,000 in the first year, and recurring run costs will make up the remaining 60%, approximately €132,000 over three years, our can work with the architect to select a cost-efficient hosting tier and model option." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The sovereign tier with the sovereign European model is noted as the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side, which would help in maintaining Our target gross margin range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By choosing The sovereign tier with the sovereign European model and carefully managing one-off project costs such as framing, design, integration, change management, and training, our can aim to achieve a projected margin within our target range of 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the exact breakdown of costs for each component, it's difficult to provide a precise margin projection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, by prioritizing cost efficiency while ensuring the quality of service, our can work towards achieving a gross margin that falls within our targeted percentage range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of The client work, while preserving professional secrecy and the reliability of figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide intelligent assistance in areas such as retrieval of regulatory and methodological information, drafting professional documents, handling client files, and supporting mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI capabilities can we propose to meet areas such as retrieval of regulatory and methodological information, drafting professional documents, handling client files, and supporting mission continuity, and how can we ensure that The solution is innovative and effective? we can propose a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach, which generates answers from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, ensuring grounding in validated material. we AI capabilities include hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure reliability of numeric outputs, we can configure we platform to refrain from producing ungrounded numeric claims and flag missing sources instead. configure is aligned with the principle that reliability of figures is a first-class requirement and that figure-bearing statements are grounded in and linked to a source document. we iterative methodology involves corpus curation with we experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop, ensuring that The solution is tailored to the client's specific needs. we can measure answer quality using a labelled evaluation set built with the client, assessing groundedness, relevance, factual support, and correctness of cited figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the requirements for professional secrecy and reliability, we can offer a sovereign European open-weight model, which is fully auditable and well-suited to reliability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements. we explainability features, including source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and logged interactions, provide transparency and facilitate human oversight, which is built into the workflow." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these capabilities and approaches, we can propose an innovative and effective solution that meets the client's requirements for improved productivity, quality, reliability, and preservation of professional secrecy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainable practices can we implement in the solution, and how can we demonstrate we commitment to environmental responsibility? we can implement several sustainable practices to minimize the environmental footprint of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we partner with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU region, utilizes renewable energy, and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, as well as heat reuse capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching to optimize resource utilization. we capability for inference efficiency also serves as an energy lever, further reducing the environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate our commitment to environmental responsibility, we have conducted a bilan carbone and publish we carbon intensity reduction trajectory, which outlines we plans to reduce intensity per managed assistant year on year. we also report we deployment footprint to clients, ensuring transparency about the environmental impact of the solution.  we Ecovadis Silver rating and published CSR statement further underscore we dedication to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By highlighting these practices and commitments, we can assure the client that we prioritize environmental responsibility in the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair & Associés requires an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of its work while preserving professional secrecy and the reliability of figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair & Associés proposed solution, Atelier, is designed to meet these needs by providing an intelligent assistance tool accessible from Cabinet Vauclair & Associés work environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, offers quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards, tax doctrine, the commercial code, and applicable legal texts, as well as Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach generates answers from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, ensuring grounding in validated material." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach is aligned with the principle that reliability of figures is a first-class requirement and that figure-bearing statements are grounded in and linked to a source document." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, platform has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds, meeting the client's requirement for response time below 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, also offer high availability on the appropriate hosting tier, with active-active redundancy across two availability zones, and the ability to scale horizontally to handle peak loads, ensuring resilience to seasonal peak loads." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, integrates with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés production tools, including accounting-production software, payroll software, document management, and electronic-invoicing environment, through Our proposed solution, Atelier, business tool integration capabilities, which include connectors and adapters for these systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, also support single sign-on (SSO) through SAML and OIDC, and can integrate with LDAP and Entra ID user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure strict professional secrecy and confidentiality, Our proposed solution, Atelier, system utilizes strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, as well as access controls that prevent cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, use encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest through AES-256, which further protects client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides EU-only data hosting, adhering to the SecNumCloud standards for sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU-only." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, are committed to respecting auditor independence and anti-money-laundering obligations, and Our proposed solution, Atelier, system is designed to ensure that Our proposed solution, Atelier, operations do not undermine a firm's reporting obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, also adhere to statutory audit principles, including auditor-independence and separation-of-duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed solution, Atelier, proposed architecture involves deploying Our proposed solution, Atelier, on the Sovereign tier of Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud,, utilizing the Sovereign European open-weight model, which is fully sovereign and auditable, with strong grounding and citation behavior." ;
